stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Reset
    Reset --> Idle : i_aresetn=1

    Idle --> DriveValid : source has beat
    DriveValid --> Transfer : TVALID=1 and TREADY=1
    DriveValid --> Stall : TVALID=1 and TREADY=0

    Stall --> Stall : hold TDATA/TUSER/TLAST stable
    Stall --> Transfer : TREADY returns high

    Transfer --> FrameStart : TUSER[0]=1
    Transfer --> LineEnd : TLAST=1
    Transfer --> DriveValid : next beat
    Transfer --> Done : final beat

    FrameStart --> DriveValid
    LineEnd --> DriveValid
    Done --> [*]
